# Custom Blinds MCP Server

A public Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for 
shop.customblinds.co.za — South Africa's first 
AI-transactable blind and shade retailer.

## Endpoint

POST https://shop.customblinds.co.za/mcp
GET  https://shop.customblinds.co.za/mcp-manifest.json

Protocol: JSON-RPC 2.0

## Available Tools

### Open (no auth required)
- search_products — filter catalogue by type and colour
- get_price — live ZAR pricing by product, width, height
- configure_product — full configuration with colour 
  validation and pricing

### Authorised (Bearer token required)
- submit_enquiry — sends enquiry to sales team
- create_order — creates draft order + Yoco payment link

## Validation

All dimension limits are pulled dynamically from the 
live pricing engine. Invalid configurations return 
structured JSON-RPC -32602 errors with field-level 
detail and suggestions.

## Discovery

llms.txt: https://customblinds.co.za/llms.txt
Manifest: https://shop.customblinds.co.za/mcp-manifest.json

## Products Supported

Roller blinds, honeycomb blinds, aluminium venetian, 
aluwood venetian, plaswood venetian, wooden venetian, 
bamboo venetian, zebra/double roller, duo roller, 
vertical blinds, outdoor blinds.

Made-to-measure. Delivered nationally across South Africa.

